      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am having the same issue exactly, furthermore lipsyncing no longer seems to function correctly. The only work around I've been able to find is using avatars without lipsyncing built in. \n\nAfter glancing through my output file I noticed the following which seems to be part of the issue\n\n2019.02.10 17:51:56 Warning    -  Plugins: Failed to load 'C:/Program Files (x86)/Steam/steamapps/common/VRChat/VRChat_Data/Plugins/OVRLipSync.dll' with error 'The specified module could not be found.",
