  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My VRChat is detecting me as a separate person. I hear myself talk and a friend and I have figured out it is a game issue. I turn down voice volume and I can’t hear it yet I don’t want to do that since I won’t be able to hear other people. This only happened after a reset my computer and redownloaded the game. I’ve unplugged my mic, uninstalled and reinstalled VRChat, uninstalled and reinstalled Steam, and just about everything else. There are no other reports of this and I am clueless on why this is happening. I have come to the conclusion that the game is reading me as different entity since my character's mouth does not move how it should like it had done before and if I shut off the voice volume it stops.",
